00:05:11,428 --> 00:05:17,428
The critics are raving... the natives are
restless... and the laughter is non-stop!

2
00:10:22,857 --> 00:10:28,857
The Gods Must Be Crazy is a action, comedy film directed by Jamie Uys.

3
00:15:34,285 --> 00:15:40,285
A Coca-Cola bottle dropped from an airplane raises havoc among a normally peaceful
tribe of African bushmen who believe it to be a utensil of the gods.

4
00:20:45,714 --> 00:20:51,714
Andrew Steyn, played by Marius Weyers.

5
